  m_text: 'The archaeologist finally escaped the ancient cave, carrying the forgotten
    symbol of seven.

    The truth was now clear. Seven was never a cursed number.
    It was a symbol of fortune, wisdom and ancient power.

    The king had hidden
    the truth from his people for generations.

    The curse was never real. The
    real curse was the fear created by the king.

    And so, the forgotten truth
    was finally revealed.'
